    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387210/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1685740761\" /></span><br><br>Mirage is a 2D action platformer-shooter game that transports you to a surreal desert world. You play as Ono, a cat; and Vio, his fireball-shooting snake friend. Together, they're on the hunt for treasure!<br><br>Traverse mystical desert architecture to explore the world of Mirage across three game levels. Each takes place in a different time, with beautiful art direction and hand-drawn animation! Maneuver your way through difficult jumps and treacherous hazards to reach the end of the ruins. Along the way, you'll encounter strange bird-like creatures called Gobs, who guard the treasure with their lives. Watch out\u2014the Gobs will be angry if you take it, and you'll have to make a daring escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387210/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1685740761\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D shooting<br></li><li>Platforming action<br></li><li>Hand-drawn character animation<br></li><li>Beautiful art direction<br></li><li>An exciting ending escape sequence to every level</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387210/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1685740761\" /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
